config BR2_PACKAGE_FX_PWM
	bool "fx-pwm"
	help
	  Userspace driver for the Ingenic X2600 PWM2 block (the AD5X piezo
	  buzzer on pc12) through the ioctl ABI of the stock soc_pwm.ko
	  kernel module (/dev/jz_pwm).

	  The stock firmware beeps by calling its own cmd_pwm tool from the
	  OEM rootfs, which the Forge-X chroot replaces - this package ships
	  the replacement so the buzzer keeps working inside the chroot.
